  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: it jumps in. X or Y",
   "J+1": "Frame {J+1}: R, the stick back and a little down: the wavedash back",
   "GO": "Frame {GO}: its aerial has missed. Dash in"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "Why it has to come",
    "text": [
     "{opp} is happy to stand out of reach. Each laser that hits adds a little damage and costs Fox nothing: after a few, waiting is no longer free for {opp}.",
     "A short hop with B pressed twice fires two lasers before Fox lands."
    ],
