       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: X or Y tapped: a short hop",
       "4": "Frame {f}: B. The first laser",
       "7": "Frame {f}: B again. The second"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "Ready for it",
    "text": [
     "When {opp} comes in, stop shooting. It jumps at Fox with its {attack}: a wavedash back takes him out from under it.",
     "It lands in front of him with landing lag: dash in on frame {GO} of its aerial, and X or Y then Z for the jump-cancelled grab."
    ],
